<title>FRANCE: GAN sells Paris office property.</title>
<headline>GAN sells Paris office property.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>French state insurer GAN said on Monday that it had sold a Paris office property to an investment fund subsidiary of Unibail.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the property comprised 12,000 square metres of space and 150 car parking places and that the deal was priced at 30,000 francs per square metre of office space.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
